flowchart TD
    subgraph ExternalEntities ["External Users"]
        CustomerUser["Student / Visitor"]
        AdminUser["Desk Staff / Operator"]
    end

    subgraph Process1 ["Process 1.0: Token Issuance & Active Session"]
        P1_Validate["Validate Service & Session"]
        P1_Format["Generate Token & Next Sequence"]
    end

    subgraph Process2 ["Process 2.0: Counter Dispatch & Lifecycle FSM"]
        P2_Guard["Guard Preconditions (Desk Vacancy)"]
        P2_Transition["Apply Status Transition & Timestamps"]
    end

    subgraph Process3 ["Process 3.0: Estimation & Analytics Engine"]
        P3_FIFO["Sort Waiting Tokens (FIFO)"]
        P3_StageA["Compute Stage A Baseline Wait"]
        P3_StageB["Compute Stage B Rolling Average"]
    end

    subgraph Process4 ["Process 4.0: Storage & Cross-Tab Synchronization"]
        P4_Validate["Validate Schema & Persist"]
        P4_Broadcast["Broadcast Event (Non-PII Metadata)"]
        P4_Reload["Reload Canonical State on Notification"]
    end

    subgraph DataStores ["Data Stores"]
        DS_QueueState[("D1: LocalStorage ('queueless_state_v1')")]
        DS_SessionToken[("D2: LocalStorage ('queueless_active_token_id_v1')")]
        DS_SyncBus[("D3: BroadcastChannel ('queueless_queue_sync_v1')")]
    end

    CustomerUser -->|Selects desk, enters name| P1_Validate
    P1_Validate -->|If valid| P1_Format
    P1_Format -->|Writes updated state| P4_Validate
    P1_Format -->|Records active token ID| DS_SessionToken
    P4_Validate -->|Saves serialized state| DS_QueueState
    P4_Validate -->|On successful commit| P4_Broadcast
    P4_Broadcast -->|Dispatches event| DS_SyncBus

    AdminUser -->|Call Next / Complete / Skip / Pause| P2_Guard
    P2_Guard -->|If valid| P2_Transition
    P2_Transition -->|Writes updated state| P4_Validate

    DS_SyncBus -->|Delivers message| P4_Reload
    P4_Reload -->|Reads canonical state| DS_QueueState
    P4_Reload -->|Updates in-memory state| Process3

    DS_QueueState -->|Loads active queue| Process3
    Process3 --> P3_FIFO
    P3_FIFO --> P3_StageA
    P3_FIFO --> P3_StageB
    P3_StageA -->|Displays wait & position| CustomerUser
    P3_StageB -->|Displays adaptive metrics| CustomerUser
    P3_StageB -->|Displays duration analytics| AdminUser

